+// PATCH (chickimmiu 2026-07-29): the CLI below runs entirely inside
+// un-awaited `void start()` promises. While tsx compiles TS off-thread
+// during startup there are moments when the main thread holds zero live
+// libuv handles; if the event loop drains in such a gap (likely on a busy
+// box), node exits 0 before the command runs — e.g. `payload migrate`
+// silently applying nothing. Hold a ref'd handle for the process lifetime;
+// every CLI path already ends in an explicit process.exit(), so this never
+// delays a normal exit.
+setInterval(() => {}, 1 << 30)
+
